==Battleground==
*1 [[Hippoe]] spawns.
*8 [[Croco]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 3.33~5 seconds<sup>100f~150f</sup>.
*5 [[Croco]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 4~6 seconds<sup>120f~180f</sup>.
*3 [[Croco]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 5.33~8 seconds<sup>160f~240f</sup>.
*1 [[Hippoe]] spawns after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
*1 [[Hippoe]] spawns after 36.67 seconds<sup>1,100f</sup>.
*5 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>, delay 3.33~5 seconds<sup>100f~150f</sup>.
*3 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>, delay 4~6 seconds<sup>120f~180f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>, delay 5.33~8 seconds<sup>160f~240f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 80% HP:
**1 [[Battle Balloon (Enemy)|Battle Balloon]] spawns as the boss.
**15 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 3.33~5 seconds<sup>100f~150f</sup>.
**5 [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn, delay 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Like the previous stage, everything here is also at 100% magnification so the stage is not that hard to beat. Although Battle Balloon does have 35,000 HP, its 1,000 damage makes it easy to deal with.

